  <status-note>
    COMPLETED 2026-09-30. Commit 8d56d47eb (+ close commit). This removed a LATENT hazard, not a live disclosure; the
    live gaps are tasks 062-067.

    Reproduce-first, live on spaarke-bff-dev: POST /api/office/share/links returned 200 with an identical fabricated
    shape for a RANDOM GUID and for a real 697,393-byte PDF, which it reported as a 245,678-byte .docx. The route
    reads nothing.

    Deleted:
    - 14 OfficeService members (-775 lines) and 4 IOfficeService members.
    - From OfficeEndpoints (-623 lines): the routes, the share group and the recent group.
    - 7 model files. AssociationType was MOVED verbatim to Models/Office/AssociationType.cs; ordinal 3 is still
      burned.
    - The rate-limit Share/Recent categories and options.
    - useShareFlow.ts.
    - The 4 Pending waivers, the contract-test regions, share-flow.spec.ts, the route mocks, 18 inert
      mockRecentApi calls, and the k6 endpoint tests.
    The 401 auth test was repointed to /search/matter-types.

    Gates:
    - Full suite 13,040 / 0 / 54, which reconciles exactly (-8 passed, -2 skipped). ArchTests 337/337.
    - Publish 45.49 -> 45.46 MB (-0.028 MB, 212 files on each side, fresh master).
    - CVE clean. Code review 0 critical. ADR check 0 violations.
    - office-addins tsc 68 (baseline); lint 0.
    - Zero route references in tracked src/ and tests/.
    - Three docs corrected.
    Deviation: the "caller cannot access" probe used an admin token, so a real document stood in.
    External callers: none in the repo; telemetry has about 1 hour of history, so it is inconclusive.
    Note: notes/058-delete-unauthorized-stub-surface.md.
  </status-note>
